  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AbstractOASIS v2.0.4\n\nConnects the OASIS to Abstract — a consumer-focused EVM L2 purpose-built for gaming and NFT apps (Ethereum-settled). Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs on Abstract Mainnet. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- Add verified zkSync and Abstract native CQL walkthroughs (a32a24e)\n- Fix Abstract CQL authority and chain configuration; document native runtime dependency (131da83)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AbstractOASIS",
